{"parse":{"title":"Eternal Speculation Engine","pageid":468157,"revid":2156040,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Eternal Speculation Engine</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c1/Talent_Eternal_Speculation_Engine.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122057\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Eternal Speculation Engine\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c1/Talent_Eternal_Speculation_Engine.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122057\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c1/Talent_Eternal_Speculation_Engine.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122057 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c1/Talent_Eternal_Speculation_Engine.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122057 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Eternal Speculation Engine\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Eternal_Speculation_Engine.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Eternal Speculation Engine.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sandrone\" title=\"Sandrone\">Sandrone</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascension_Talent\" title=\"Ascension Talent\">Ascension</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\"><b>Radiance: Stellar Glimmer</b></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Radiance: Stellar Glimmer</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Radiance: Stellar-Conduct and Radiance: Stellar Swirl are both considered Radiance: Stellar Glimmer states.<br />Characters can only be affected by one Radiance state at any one time, and where more than one state can be triggered, Radiance: Stellar-Conduct shall apply first.</span></span></span>: When using the Elemental Skill <a href=\"/wiki/Formule_Phenomenale:_Differential_Analysis\" title=\"Formule Phenomenale: Differential Analysis\">Formule Phenomenale: Differential Analysis</a>, if Fagio's <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Decoding Power</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Decoding Power</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">When in Decoding mode, Fagio's Decoding Power will continuously increase. When its Decoding Power reaches the maximum, Fagio will be unable to maintain or re-enter Decoding mode.</span></span></span> is greater than 50, the second Prism Shot fired by Fagio at nearby opponents will deal 400% of its original DMG as Fagio's Decoding Power is decreased.<br />Additionally, for every 10 points of Decoding Power Fagio loses, it gains 1 stack of Refined Tactics for 60s (max 10 stacks). When Sandrone uses the Elemental Burst <a href=\"/wiki/Formule_Phenomenale:_Q.E.D.\" title=\"Formule Phenomenale: Q.E.D.\">Formule Phenomenale: Q.E.D.</a> while in the Radiance: Stellar-Conduct state, all stacks of Refined Tactics are cleared, causing the Convective Inhibition Ray to deal 100% + (number of stacks cleared) × 10% of its original DMG.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Base_DMG_Multiplier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base DMG Multiplier\">Base DMG Multiplier</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Eternal Speculation Engine</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Sandrone\" title=\"Sandrone\">Sandrone</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEternal_Speculation_Engine%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Eternal Speculation Engine</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">悠久的演算机关</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Yōujiǔ de Yǎnsuàn Jīguān</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Eternal Calculation Mechanism</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">悠久的演算機關</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Yōujiǔ de Yǎnsuàn Jīguān</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">悠久の演算機関</span><br /><small><i>Yuukyuu no Enzan Kikan</i></small></td><td>Eternal Calculation Mechanism</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">유구한</span> <span lang=\"ko\">연산</span> <span lang=\"ko\">장치</span><br /><small><i>Yuguhan Yeonsan Jangchi</i></small></td><td>Distinguished Calculation Device</td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Mecanismo de c<span lang=\"es\">ó</span>mputo arcaico</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Moteur de sp<span lang=\"fr\">é</span>culation <span lang=\"fr\">é</span>ternelle</td><td>Eternal Speculation Engine</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Вечный</span> <span lang=\"ru\">вычислительный</span> <span lang=\"ru\">механизм</span><br /><small><i>Vechnyy vychislitel'nyy mekhanizm</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Eternal Speculation Engine</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Cỗ Máy Tính Toán Lâu Đời</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Uralte Rechenvorrichtung</td><td>Ancient Calculating Device</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>Eternal Speculation Engine</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>Calculadora Antiga</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>Sonsuz Tahmin Motoru</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Motore di calcolo eterno</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEternal_Speculation_Engine%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/Luna_VIII\" title=\"Version/Luna VIII\">Version \"Luna VII