 class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_Lady%27s_Code_of_Conduct\" title=\"A Lady&#39;s Code of Conduct\"><img alt=\"Talent A Lady&#39;s Code of Conduct\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent A Lady&#39;s Code of Conduct.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_A_Lady%27s_Code_of_Conduct.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b5/Talent_A_Lady%27s_Code_of_Conduct.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20260701122055\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/A_Lady%27s_Code_of_Conduct\" title=\"A Lady&#39;s Code of Conduct\">A Lady's Code of Conduct</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>Stellar Jubilee </small><br /><b>Passive</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Light_of_Rationalisme\" title=\"Light of Rationalisme\"><img alt=\"Talent Light of Rationalisme\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Light of Rationalisme.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Light_of_Rationalisme.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/33/Talent_Light_of_Rationalisme.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20260701122100\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Light_of_Rationalisme\" title=\"Light of Rationalisme\">Light of Rationalisme</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>Utility </small><br /><b>Passive</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_Caucus_Prelude_and_a_Long_Tale\" title=\"A Caucus Prelude and a Long Tale\"><img alt=\"Talent A Caucus Prelude and a Long Tale\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAA